    IF `the justice or judge is satisfied by information on oath in Form 5.0031 that the conditions specified in subsection (2) are met`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Before renewing the order, the justice or judge must be satisfied by information on oath in Form 5.0031"

